WEBVTT

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:44.340
Cheers!

00:01:44.430 --> 00:01:45.070
Congrats.

00:01:45.150 --> 00:01:46.310
Happy New Year!

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:50.540
Hits the spot!

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:52.590
I'm gonna get
blitzed tonight!

00:01:52.930 --> 00:01:54.540
Drink it down!

00:01:56.370 --> 00:01:57.850
Godai, how was
your trip home?

00:01:57.930 --> 00:01:59.930
Lousy. I slaved
at the restaurant.

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:02.560
Poor guy.
Have another.

00:02:05.280 --> 00:02:06.900
Manage to take
any side trips?

00:02:07.340 --> 00:02:10.310
Get real! I couldn't
afford the trip home!

00:02:10.680 --> 00:02:12.680
Isee.
That's too bad.

00:02:13.380 --> 00:02:14.650
There's our snacks!

00:02:14.910 --> 00:02:19.080
I was thinking of taking a
week off, and going to Izu.

00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:20.590
Good for you.

00:02:21.330 --> 00:02:22.250
Have some.

00:02:23.270 --> 00:02:24.380
O-Okay.

00:02:24.830 --> 00:02:27.910
You got any plans this week?
A date or something?

00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:29.590
No. Just work.

00:02:29.810 --> 00:02:30.900
What a man!

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:34.160
Have another.

00:02:34.740 --> 00:02:36.360
What's wrong?
Drink up!

00:02:36.870 --> 00:02:39.400
You're not eating that?
Want something else? Okay.

00:02:39.810 --> 00:02:43.050
Buddy! Two oden and
10 skewers of yakitori!

00:02:43.280 --> 00:02:45.620
Salt the yakitori, and
make the oden spicy!

00:02:45.680 --> 00:02:46.520
Comin' up!

00:02:47.960 --> 00:02:50.080
Drink up!
I'm buyin' tonight!

00:02:50.860 --> 00:02:52.470
Really? Thanks!

00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:53.990
It's spilling.

00:02:56.960 --> 00:02:57.800
What's wrong?

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:01.650
Nothing. T-This is
really nice of you.

00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:26.220
A cat!?
What do you mean?

00:03:26.590 --> 00:03:29.860
You don't know?
They're quiet things that meow.

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:31.810
I'm not asking that!

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:34.210
When did I
promise to take a cat?

00:03:34.460 --> 00:03:35.060
Last night.

00:03:36.130 --> 00:03:37.930
Don't say you
don't remember.

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:40.590
You gave me your word.

00:03:41.210 --> 00:03:44.300
Oh yeah! You plied
me with liquor last night.

00:03:44.810 --> 00:03:47.530
I paid for the
entire bill, last night!

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:50.240
Oh, there she is.

00:03:51.340 --> 00:03:53.460
Hey! You play dirty,
Sakamoto!

00:03:55.780 --> 00:03:56.970
Was it cold out?

00:03:59.030 --> 00:04:01.490
There, there.
Isn't she cute?

00:04:02.060 --> 00:04:04.250
Cats are against
apartment rules.

00:04:04.960 --> 00:04:07.960
So who was the macho
dude who said, "No problem?"

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:09.360
I wonder myself.

00:04:12.210 --> 00:04:14.460
Okay Kyoko,
say "hi."

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:15.670
Kyoko!?

00:04:17.410 --> 00:04:18.060
That's right.

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:21.410
The minute you
heard her name--

00:04:22.010 --> 00:04:23.180
Kyoko!?

00:04:24.050 --> 00:04:26.310
Why didn't you
say so earlier?

00:04:28.180 --> 00:04:29.270
Just leave her to me!

00:04:31.880 --> 00:04:32.570
It's possible--

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:34.940
Well, anything to
say for yourself?

00:04:36.760 --> 00:04:39.670
See? Kyoko really
likes you, too.

00:04:44.410 --> 00:04:47.060
But why'd you
name her Kyoko?

00:04:47.430 --> 00:04:50.500
I'm a fan of
your manager.

00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:53.190
Don't give the manager's
name to animals!

00:04:53.940 --> 00:04:56.430
What's it to you?
It's a free country.

00:04:56.620 --> 00:04:59.180
But what'll happen when I
call her at the aparrtment?

00:04:59.420 --> 00:05:00.500
I can't say
"Kyoko."

00:05:00.660 --> 00:05:04.270
But you have to call her
"Kyoko" or she won't come.

00:05:05.180 --> 00:05:08.050
Let's see, the 1:25
departure goes to Nishi-Izu--

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:31.760
Not a peep out
of you. You hear?

00:05:37.120 --> 00:05:38.010
Godai!

00:05:38.660 --> 00:05:39.250
I'm home.

00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:42.350
You should contact me if
you're not coming home.

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:43.570
I'm sorry.

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:46.380
I waited up with the front
door unlocked half the night!

00:05:47.170 --> 00:05:48.000
I'm very sor--

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:49.500
Hey, K--

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:53.740
K-- Cute little
clouds today.

00:06:03.070 --> 00:06:06.190
That was close, and it
would've been all your fault!

00:06:10.490 --> 00:06:12.810
You hungry? Hold on.
I'll make you lunch.

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:19.010
Just wait.
Canned food.

00:06:20.170 --> 00:06:21.360
Dry food.

00:06:22.100 --> 00:06:25.450
For kittens, moisten
with milk or water.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:32.170
Hold it, I said!
It's almost ready.

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:34.000
Where's the opener?

00:06:35.270 --> 00:06:36.000
There!

00:06:37.350 --> 00:06:38.060
Here you go--

00:06:47.660 --> 00:06:48.580
Kyoko!

00:06:50.230 --> 00:06:52.160
Don't do that here!

00:06:53.870 --> 00:06:54.510
Hey!

00:06:59.670 --> 00:07:01.060
Kyoko! Come here!

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:03.700
You can't
hide from me!

00:07:04.810 --> 00:07:06.300
I said, come here!

00:07:06.640 --> 00:07:07.120
Godai!

00:07:08.550 --> 00:07:09.740
Do you need
something?

00:07:11.420 --> 00:07:12.970
Godai?
Excuse me!

00:07:14.860 --> 00:07:15.500
Okay!

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:18.430
Manager, is
something wrong?

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:20.250
You just called me!

00:07:20.890 --> 00:07:24.080
I am not hiding!
Tell me what you want!

00:07:24.560 --> 00:07:25.950
Did I call you?

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:29.080
You did!
You called "Kyoko."

00:07:30.110 --> 00:07:33.170
We're not really on a
first-name basis, Manager.

00:07:33.610 --> 00:07:35.040
But I heard--

00:07:35.570 --> 00:07:36.740
That's strange.

00:07:37.480 --> 00:07:38.970
It is strange.

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:42.610
So you don't
need anything?

00:07:43.310 --> 00:07:45.040
N-Not at all.

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:47.410
Then I'm sorry
to bother you.

00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:48.910
It's all right.

00:07:57.670 --> 00:07:58.450
Kyoko.

00:08:00.630 --> 00:08:02.800
Come here.
I won't spank you.

00:08:07.610 --> 00:08:08.730
Mr. Yotsuya!

00:08:14.270 --> 00:08:16.760
Come here, Kyoko.

00:08:16.940 --> 00:08:18.970
Don't just call
her "Kyoko"!

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:23.060
Why not? Isn't
Kyoko her name?

00:08:23.490 --> 00:08:26.880
You're not on a first-name
basis with the manager, either.

00:08:27.560 --> 00:08:31.120
There, there.
How precious.

00:08:35.940 --> 00:08:38.120
This is a cat
young man.

00:08:38.530 --> 00:08:39.790
I know that!

00:08:40.740 --> 00:08:42.660
And a feminine feline.

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:44.840
What are
you looking at!?

00:08:45.270 --> 00:08:47.670
Isn't it perilous
buying a cat?

00:08:47.850 --> 00:08:48.770
I'm just taking
care of it.

00:08:48.850 --> 00:08:51.210
Shall I inform the manager?

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:53.250
I said, I'm just
taking care of it!

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:55.080
You're gonna get it!

00:08:59.280 --> 00:09:00.260
All right!

00:09:01.730 --> 00:09:04.820
I'll treat you
to one dinner!

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:08.140
That was all I desired.
One Tempura Deluxe.

00:09:09.600 --> 00:09:14.650
Damn! Sakamoto'd
better pay For this!

00:09:25.090 --> 00:09:26.610
Would you like
some shrimp?

00:09:27.690 --> 00:09:28.510
Mr. Yotsuya!

00:09:29.550 --> 00:09:31.270
Don't feed her
human food!

00:09:31.830 --> 00:09:32.990
Here's YOUR food.

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:34.010
Godai!

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:35.800
Show me the cat!

00:09:37.370 --> 00:09:38.650
Mr. Yotsuya!

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:42.000
I never told
the manager!

00:09:42.390 --> 00:09:43.730
Where's the cat?

00:09:44.400 --> 00:09:45.920
Found you!

00:09:46.740 --> 00:09:50.630
You were hiding. Cute!
You're still a kitten!

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:52.260
Whitey!

00:09:53.770 --> 00:09:54.240
Snowball!

00:09:55.450 --> 00:09:55.840
Sugar?

00:09:57.090 --> 00:09:59.250
So what's the
cat's name?

00:10:02.360 --> 00:10:03.780
What's its name?

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:06.750
Well, it's--

00:10:10.600 --> 00:10:11.990
You like that?

00:10:14.030 --> 00:10:15.590
So what's its name?

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:18.330
Go ahead
and tell her.

00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:27.580
Nice aroma.

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:28.870
KYOKO!?

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:35.750
Hey, I told
you not to shout!

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:37.900
But you
surprised me!

00:10:39.250 --> 00:10:41.300
Akemi, did
you call me?

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:45.250
Akemi, make
something up!

00:10:45.520 --> 00:10:47.220
I'm a bad liar.

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:48.910
Who cares!?
Make something up!

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:49.980
Akemi!

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:52.780
Hurry!
Hurry!

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:54.790
Sure.

00:11:06.250 --> 00:11:07.610
Akemi, what--

00:11:09.490 --> 00:11:10.710
Manager.

00:11:10.780 --> 00:11:12.900
I'm so glad
you're here.

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:17.370
What happened?
Akemi?

00:11:17.660 --> 00:11:20.070
I'm all right.
He didn't get far.

00:11:20.290 --> 00:11:21.090
"G-Get far"?

00:11:22.100 --> 00:11:25.050
Godai suddenly
assaulted me.

00:11:25.400 --> 00:11:26.340
What was that!?

00:11:30.350 --> 00:11:32.940
Godai, you
are just so--

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:37.240
She's lying!
Akemi, you jerk!

00:11:38.690 --> 00:11:40.450
Have you no
shame, Godai!?

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:42.850
No!
Manager!

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:46.370
I TOLD you
I was a bad liar.

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:49.640
That's right!
It was a lie! A lie!

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:54.460
So why
is she lying?

00:11:56.070 --> 00:11:56.890
She--

00:11:59.710 --> 00:12:00.360
Kyoko!

00:12:06.540 --> 00:12:07.600
What are you doing!?

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:09.210
I'm just--

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:11.840
Do you enjoy
making fun of me!?

00:12:11.910 --> 00:12:13.630
No! That's
not it at all!

00:12:14.860 --> 00:12:16.580
Are you all alone?

00:12:34.340 --> 00:12:36.960
Damn!
It's still wet.

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:39.530
And Akemi
never changes.

00:12:45.720 --> 00:12:47.580
You've got it
easy, don't you?

00:13:00.120 --> 00:13:02.120
Darn that
Sakamoto, anyway!

00:13:11.270 --> 00:13:13.570
You know
it's all your fault!

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:21.160
C'mon.

00:13:37.340 --> 00:13:37.920
Kyoko--

00:13:59.840 --> 00:14:00.670
AFter that...

00:14:01.850 --> 00:14:04.100
...2 or 3
uneventful days passed.

00:14:05.870 --> 00:14:07.390
And before I
knew i't...

00:14:14.690 --> 00:14:18.050
...I started to
develop feelings.

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:25.170
Wanna come
to school?

00:14:49.690 --> 00:14:50.770
Kyoko!
Kyoko!

00:14:52.850 --> 00:14:53.580
Kyoko!

00:15:10.950 --> 00:15:13.680
Who brought a cat
into MY classroom!

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:16.540
I did.
I'm sorry.

00:15:19.010 --> 00:15:21.770
Go back to
ronin school!

00:15:37.270 --> 00:15:40.500
What is it?
What do you want?

00:15:42.900 --> 00:15:44.460
Stop that,
Soichiro!

00:15:45.050 --> 00:15:46.020
I'm home.

00:15:46.510 --> 00:15:47.350
Welcome back.

00:15:48.290 --> 00:15:51.690
Godai, are you hiding
something from me?

00:15:52.920 --> 00:15:54.210
N-No!
Nothing!

00:15:58.830 --> 00:16:00.110
Why?

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:03.510
Because Soichiro started barking
the moment he saw you.

00:16:06.800 --> 00:16:09.850
Maybe it's a showing
of male solidarity.

00:16:16.470 --> 00:16:18.310
You really aren't
hiding anything?

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:18.990
Nothing!

00:16:20.180 --> 00:16:21.720
C-Can I go?

00:16:22.380 --> 00:16:23.040
Be my guest.

00:16:40.570 --> 00:16:42.520
Godai!
Phone!

00:16:42.840 --> 00:16:43.520
Okay!

00:16:44.840 --> 00:16:47.070
Thanks for calling me.
Who is it?

00:16:47.310 --> 00:16:48.970
Sorry to disappoint you.
It's a guy.

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:51.630
Hello?

00:16:52.450 --> 00:16:53.710
Sakamoto!

00:16:54.820 --> 00:16:56.210
Kyoko?
She's fine.

00:16:56.920 --> 00:16:59.680
When did he start calling the
manager by her first name?

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:02.220
She sleeps with
me every night.

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:07.610
Before I know it, she's already
in bed beside me. She's so cute.

00:17:08.070 --> 00:17:09.050
What the--

00:17:10.540 --> 00:17:12.620
So they've
already done i't.

00:17:13.600 --> 00:17:14.560
That's right.

00:18:21.630 --> 00:18:23.800
Your change is 50.
Thank you.

00:18:24.170 --> 00:18:25.230
Manager!

00:18:26.630 --> 00:18:28.500
Mrs. Ichinose.
Out shopping?

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:29.600
Yeah, kinda.

00:18:31.940 --> 00:18:34.350
What's the
big grin for?

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:41.670
You're better at hiding
things than I thought.

00:18:42.650 --> 00:18:44.280
What are you--

00:18:46.060 --> 00:18:47.020
Look at you!

00:18:49.030 --> 00:18:51.320
Mrs. Ichinose?
Really, what is it?

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:54.450
I heard all
about it by accident.

00:18:57.580 --> 00:19:01.160
But I'm kinda relieved.
You're a normal girl after all.

00:19:11.090 --> 00:19:13.780
I AM NOT SHACKING UP
WITH ANYBODY!

00:19:30.840 --> 00:19:34.600
But I heard him. He was
calling you "Kyoko, Kyoko."

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:39.010
Kyoko!
Where'd you go?

00:19:40.640 --> 00:19:41.430
Kyoko!

00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:45.850
Kyoko!
Little Kyoko!

00:19:47.210 --> 00:19:50.780
Oh, no!
Where'd you go, Kyoko?

00:19:52.190 --> 00:19:53.620
I'm right here!

00:20:13.850 --> 00:20:18.100
Tell me just when
I climbed into your bed!

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:28.440
I heard it all. You sleep
with her every night.

00:20:29.960 --> 00:20:31.020
Mrs. Ichinose!

00:20:31.300 --> 00:20:34.060
It's no big deal.
Get it out in the open!

00:20:34.130 --> 00:20:35.030
You're wrong!

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:37.890
Then explain it so
we all can understand.

00:20:39.430 --> 00:20:39.860
I--

00:20:39.930 --> 00:20:40.560
You--?

00:20:41.940 --> 00:20:42.740
I--

00:20:45.580 --> 00:20:46.360
Actually--

00:20:52.090 --> 00:20:54.410
Don't you think this
room stinks of fish?

00:20:57.530 --> 00:20:58.880
Now that you
mention it--

00:20:59.300 --> 00:21:00.060
You think so?

00:21:04.430 --> 00:21:04.830
What?

00:21:09.460 --> 00:21:11.020
This is cat food!

00:21:11.310 --> 00:21:12.000
Yeah--

00:21:15.510 --> 00:21:17.620
Have you been
reduced to eating this?

00:21:19.320 --> 00:21:20.480
Now, wait!

00:21:20.610 --> 00:21:21.240
A cat food can!

00:21:22.410 --> 00:21:24.700
Then Kyoko is--

00:21:25.490 --> 00:21:25.960
Right.

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:29.670
If you meant a cat, you could
have said so from the start!

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:30.180
Right.

00:21:31.420 --> 00:21:32.980
That's dull.

00:22:21.170 --> 00:22:22.360
Kyoko!

00:22:22.700 --> 00:22:24.040
Kyoko!

00:22:26.250 --> 00:22:27.270
Kyoko!

00:22:27.910 --> 00:22:29.750
Sorry to involve
you in this.

00:22:29.880 --> 00:22:30.710
It's all right.

00:22:31.350 --> 00:22:32.640
Kyoko!

00:22:32.710 --> 00:22:34.480
Kyoko!

00:22:35.420 --> 00:22:37.550
Why did he
pick that name?

00:22:38.920 --> 00:22:40.260
I'm home!

00:22:42.190 --> 00:22:43.030
Soichiro!

00:22:47.430 --> 00:22:48.030
Huh?

00:22:50.360 --> 00:22:51.120
Kyoko?

00:22:56.170 --> 00:22:59.360
Manager! Come here!
Hurry, come here!

00:23:00.480 --> 00:23:01.600
Hello, Kentaro!

00:23:01.680 --> 00:23:02.740
Get a load of this!

00:23:03.350 --> 00:23:04.040
What?

00:23:05.350 --> 00:23:06.680
Isn't that cool!?

00:23:07.150 --> 00:23:08.610
What's up?

00:23:10.530 --> 00:23:12.180
I get it.

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:16.110
K-Kyoko!

00:23:22.840 --> 00:23:23.920
I'm glad she's safe.

00:23:24.540 --> 00:23:25.000
Yep.

00:23:29.480 --> 00:23:30.400
But just look.

00:23:31.980 --> 00:23:33.270
That's where
Kyoko should be.

00:23:50.690 --> 00:23:51.560
I'm not listening!

00:23:51.630 --> 00:23:55.230
I won't quit as manager of
Maison Ikkoku, no matter what!

00:23:56.660 --> 00:23:58.290
My parents
can be so--

00:23:59.200 --> 00:24:03.300
Next: "Godai Gets a Shock!
Kyoko Calls it Quits"

00:24:04.050 --> 00:24:06.740
It may be old,
but it's my home!
